{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104430","id":2409084287,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Pl7V_","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104430","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104430.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104430.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104430","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104430/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104430/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104430/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bfc1ef4ab7ea53f7590ab77c416b8c124fe60ca3","number":104430,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Optimize `TextServerAdvanced::_add_features` by using iteration instead of `.values()` and `.keys()`","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I profiled the launch of an empty project and noticed this little contributor:\r\n```\r\n122.00 ms  100,0 %\t8.00 ms\t   TextServerAdvanced::_shape_run(TextServerAdvanced::ShapedTextDataAdvanced*, long long, long long, hb_script_t, hb_direction_t, TypedArray<RID>, long long, long long, long long, long long, RID\r\n```\r\n\r\nIts contribution can be reduced by 5% (a few ms) by using an iterator pattern, removing these contributors:\r\n```\r\n5.00 ms   4,1 %\t0 s\t    Dictionary::values() const\r\n2.00 ms   1,6 %\t1.00 ms\t    Dictionary::keys() const\r\n1.00 ms   0,8 %\t1.00 ms\t    Array::~Array()\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Addendum\r\nIt would be interesting to change `glyphs` to `LocalVector` (from `Vector`) and resize it fittingly, avoiding reallocations, because that contribution is also large:\r\n```\r\n17.00 ms  13,9 %\t0 s\t    Vector<Glyph>::push_back(Glyph)\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever, that's more effort, so it can be done some other time.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"